  "releaseNotes": "Add runtime plugin DLL loading and HTTP remainder processing:\n      - Introduced a runtime plugin loader to automatically discover and load DLLs from the plugins directory at application startup.\n      - Added an AssemblyResolve handler to resolve missing dependencies from the plugins directory and its subdirectories.\n      - Triggered plugin loader initialization during core static startup to ensure assemblies are available before runtime usage.\n      - Extended HTTP model parsing with remainder accessors to expose unconsumed bytes after body parsing.\n      - Refactored HTTP session receive flow to continue processing buffered remainder data, improving support for pipelined/stacked requests.",
